---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="TakeoutFix | Terms of Service" description="Read the Terms of Service for TakeoutFix. Understand your rights, licensing, user responsibilities, and limitations of liability.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 mt-12 font-sans">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6 font-mono">
        Legal Agreements &amp; Terms
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Last updated: September 28, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-12 leading-relaxed">
      
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          By accessing and using TakeoutFix, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use our service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">2. License Grant</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          TakeoutFix grants you a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to use the software solely for recovering metadata from your own Google Takeout exports. The software operates locally on your device.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">3. User Responsibilities</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          You agree to use TakeoutFix only for lawful purposes. You are responsible for ensuring you have the legal right to process the Google Takeout data you provide to the application.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">4. Software Access &amp; Pricing</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          TakeoutFix is provided as a 100% free, client-side utility. All users have full, unrestricted access to the complete metadata restoration engine directly in their browser without required subscriptions, hidden paywalls, or fees. Optional donations and sponsorships may be provided via public GitHub Sponsors.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          TakeoutFix modifies local files at your request. We strongly recommend maintaining backups of your original Google Takeout exports and destination folders. TakeoutFix is provided "as is" without warranty of any kind. In no event shall we be liable for data loss, corruption, or indirect damages arising from the use of this software.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">6. Termination</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We reserve the right to suspend or terminate access to community services (such as public reviews or support tickets) if you violate these terms or engage in abusive conduct.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">7. Governing Law</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          These terms are governed by the laws of your jurisdiction. Any disputes shall be resolved in the competent courts of that jurisdiction.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">8. Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          If you have questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us via our <a href="/contact" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 hover:underline font-semibold">Contact Page</a> or directly via email at <a href="mailto:takeoutfix.support@gmail.com" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 hover:underline font-semibold">takeoutfix.support@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
